{"id":"4a7daf0e05186250","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-model9-admissible-fragment.md","title":"ZFC Model9 Admissible Fragment","display":"df-zfc-model9-admissible-fragment — ZFC Model9 Admissible Fragment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model9-admissible-fragment","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model9-admissible-fragment"],"display":"df-zfc-model9-admissible-fragment — ZFC Model9 Admissible Fragment","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-transitive]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set]]","[[../batch13/58-df-kripke-platek.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model9-admissible-fragment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model9-admissible-fragment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model9-admissible-fragment — ZFC Model9 Admissible Fragment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"58-df-transitive\">58-df-transitive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e75cf0c92655d78\" href=\"?note=1e75cf0c92655d78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set\">58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8d1853eb0947b911\" href=\"?note=8d1853eb0947b911\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-kripke-platek.md\">../batch13/58-df-kripke-platek.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (candidate admissible fragment)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}\\)</span> (additional theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> (transitivity predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KP}\">\\(\\operatorname{KP}\\)</span> (Kripke-Platek axiom set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}\\)</span> (sentences in the membership language)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}\\)</span> (two-place model predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9AdmissibleFragment}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9AdmissibleFragment}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KP}\">\\(\\operatorname{KP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}\\)</span> 及无穷公理的取舍固定为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8d1853eb0947b911\" href=\"?note=8d1853eb0947b911\" title=\"58-df-kripke-platek\">58-df-kripke-platek</a> 中的显式编码；不再把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KP}\">\\(\\operatorname{KP}\\)</span> 当作可自由选择的理论参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}fragment} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9AdmissibleFragment}_S(A,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S(A)\\land\\operatorname{KP}\\cup\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\langle A,\\in\\cap(A\\times A)\\rangle,\\operatorname{KP}\\cup\\Gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}fragment} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9AdmissibleFragment}_S(A,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S(A)\\land\\operatorname{KP}\\cup\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\langle A,\\in\\cap(A\\times A)\\rangle,\\operatorname{KP}\\cup\\Gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Satisfaction is routed through the sourced two-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}\\)</span> predicate on the explicit membership structure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"1e75cf0c92655d78","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58